In the 1956 first round revision table of variant Chinese characters ({{lw|zh|第一批异体字整理表}}) by the People's Republic of China, {{l|zh|蒞}} and {{l|zh|涖}} were listed as {{w|Variant Chinese characters|variant forms}} that were replaced by <big>莅</big> as the orthodox form.  <!-- Refer https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/第一批异体字整理表/1955年 -->

===Etymology 1===
{{zh-see|蒞|sv}}

===Etymology 2===
{{zh-see|涖}}

===Usage notes===
* In mainland China, {{l|zh|蒞}} and {{l|zh|涖}} are considered as {{w|Variant Chinese characters|variant forms}} of <big>莅</big> which is used as the orthodox form.
* In Taiwan, {{l|zh|蒞}} is considered as the orthodox form while {{l|zh|涖}} is a variant form of {{l|zh|蒞}}. This character, <big>莅</big> is a rarely encountered character ({{l|zh|生僻字}}) in modern Taiwan.

